Subject: [PATCH] PI texdict review fixes (delta on top of 0009)

4 bit = one index per byte, opaque palettised textures get PAL|C888 (d3d rasterFromImage accepts it), auto mipmaps for single images with filter not 1/2, legacy deviceId 0 layout, UTF-16 names, version window, gamma skipped (engine gamma 1.0).
